        "card_CznQTH": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li>Small but mighty algae is super food but for your skin because of the nutrient rich nature of the ingredient.</li><li>Super ingredient known for it’s moisture locking properties. Studies have shown microalgae extracts to stimulate collagen production leaving your skin looking hydrated and firmer. Plus it’s rich in antioxidants helping combat free radicals that accelerate aging and skin damage.</li></ul>",
